parsed.grading_scheme:
(a) 3 points: {1 point: constant and limits, 2 points: integrand}

(b) 3 points: {1 point: $\frac{dy}{d\theta} = \frac{dr}{d\theta}\sin\theta + r\cos\theta$ or $\frac{dx}{d\theta} = \frac{dr}{d\theta}\cos\theta - r\sin\theta$, 1 point: $\frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{\frac{dy}{d\theta}\sin\theta + r\cos\theta}{\frac{dr}{d\theta}\cos\theta - r\sin\theta}$, 1 point: answer}

(c) 3 points: {1 point: $\frac{dr}{dt} = \frac{dr}{d\theta}\frac{d\theta}{dt}$, 1 point: $\frac{d\theta}{dt} = \frac{dr}{dt} \cdot \frac{1}{-2\sin\theta}$, 1 point: answer with units}
